194
00:23:35.833 --> 00:23:37.870
What happened?
I didn't see anything.

195
00:23:41.250 --> 00:23:42.661
- Did you kill him?
- Does it work?

196
00:23:52.000 --> 00:23:53.035
Please...

197
00:23:59.958 --> 00:24:01.073
Can I have it back?

198
00:24:15.917 --> 00:24:17.828
